How to give Muse "side chats" a group chat ( just like Grok Bot) [WITH VIDEO]

Meta Muse feels like one personal assistant. Grok Bot feels like a team of them. You can give Muse the team part too, and this is how we did it with ours. 👇

@Muse gives you side chats. The main chat https://t.co/odKVuTTxxe

@thtbee_ I hate that people hyped up Grokbot’s VM when it can’t even really be accessed by SSH.

Technically you can tailscale in, but it’s useless because it goes to sleep within 10 mins if Grokbot isn’t actively using it.

Gemini Spark had an equivalent VM functionality before Grokbot.
